@startuml sequence-end
title 時序圖：結束保存與重啟
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
autonumber

actor "老師" as Teacher
participant "POST /api/activities/{id}/end" as Api
participant "ActivityEngine" as Engine
participant "SqliteActivityRepository" as Repo
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "Hub" as Hub
participant "各組視窗" as Students

Teacher -> Api : 結束活動
Api -> Engine : end()
activate Engine
Engine -> Repo : persist_results(全部送出)
Repo -> DB : 一筆交易：送出、答案、階段 = 已結束
alt 寫入失敗
  Engine --> Api : PersistFailed
  Api --> Teacher : 500「結果保存失敗，活動仍在進行中，請再試一次」
  note right : 維持搶答中，不推播
else 寫入成功
  Engine -> Engine : 階段 = 已結束，清除所有冷卻
  Engine --> Api : phaseChanged、snapshot
  deactivate Engine
  Api -> Hub : dispatch
  Hub -> Students : 已結束＋含完整結果的快照
end

== 伺服器重啟 ==
participant "create_app" as App
App -> Repo : mark_unfinished_interrupted()
Repo -> DB : 準備中、搶答中 → 已中斷
note over Students : 舊 Token 全部失效；學生頁以公開的階段查詢\n顯示「活動已中斷，請老師重新建立」
Teacher -> Api : 檢視已結束的活動、判定無效、寫回、匯出 CSV
Api -> Repo : 從資料庫載入已結束的活動
@enduml
